WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.488
Put the stages side by side
and the direction is clear.

2
00:00:03.488 --> 00:00:07.462
Today, Windows authentication,
and TLS is optional.

3
00:00:07.462 --> 00:00:13.689
During coexistence, Windows and Entra
logins run together, TLS becomes mandatory,

4
00:00:13.689 --> 00:00:18.176
and SQL Server 2022 carries an
app certificate in Key Vault.

5
00:00:18.176 --> 00:00:22.803
After AD, it's Entra logins only,
applications use managed identities,

6
00:00:22.803 --> 00:00:27.675
and the TLS certificate comes from
the standalone CA under the same root.

7
00:00:27.675 --> 00:00:31.745
The program's advice is simple:
move to SQL Server 2025,

8
00:00:31.745 --> 00:00:34.613
so one whole certificate disappears.

9
00:00:34.613 --> 00:00:36.820
Next, the clouds' key vaults.
